--- OLD
    LDA #$41
    STA music_track        ; Start up the crystal theme music
--- NEW
    ;  Start up the crystal theme music -- unless it is playing already,
    ;  the title rebuilding after one of its screens (opt_titlemusic).  The
    ;  four bytes the LDA and STA took.
.import opt_titlemusic
    JSL opt_titlemusic + OPTFAR
